    <briefdescription>
<para>A line-segment graphical primitive. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1scene_1_1meta_1_1Line" kindref="compound">Line</ref> represents a straight segment between two three-dimensional positions.</para>
<para>A line has independently configurable color, width, and rendering style. </para>
